sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Super Admin
    actor Employee
    participant Portal as Super Admin Portal :3013
    participant InventoryApp as Inventory App :3004
    participant Gateway as API Gateway :8080
    participant Identity as User Service
    participant IdentityDB as User Service PostgreSQL
    participant Inventory as Inventory Service
    participant InventoryDB as Inventory PostgreSQL

    Admin->>Portal: Sign in with platform account
    Portal->>Gateway: Create Client A and Client B; enable Inventory for A
    Gateway->>Identity: Verify platform token and route control-plane request
    Identity->>IdentityDB: Persist tenants and entitlement
    Admin->>Portal: Add employee and grant Inventory to Client A
    Portal->>Gateway: Create membership and app grant
    Gateway->>Identity: Verify current Super Admin role
    Identity->>IdentityDB: Persist membership, role, grant and audit event

    Employee->>InventoryApp: Sign in with email, password and Client A slug
    InventoryApp->>Gateway: POST /api/users/login/application
    Gateway->>Identity: Authenticate and resolve tenant-scoped access
    Identity->>IdentityDB: Check membership, entitlement, grant and role
    Identity-->>InventoryApp: Short-lived signed Inventory token

    Employee->>InventoryApp: List or adjust inventory
    InventoryApp->>Gateway: Inventory API with signed token
    Gateway->>Inventory: Route request; pass verified identity context
    Inventory->>Identity: Internal signed-token and current-grant check
    Identity->>IdentityDB: Recheck active user, membership, entitlement and grant
    Identity-->>Inventory: 204 current grant
    Inventory->>InventoryDB: Query/update rows scoped to token tenant ID
    Inventory-->>Employee: Only Client A inventory

    Admin->>Portal: Revoke employee Inventory grant
    Portal->>Gateway: DELETE application grant
    Gateway->>Identity: Verify current Super Admin role
    Identity->>IdentityDB: Revoke grant and write audit event
    Employee->>Inventory: Reuse prior token
    Inventory->>Identity: Recheck current grant
    Identity-->>Inventory: 403 grant revoked
    Inventory-->>Employee: Access denied
